+# @key-wait: Whether the most recent FX0A remains waiting for a key.
+# @phase-numerator: Fractional remainder in the 60 Hz virtual-clock divider.
+# @key-wait-stop-owned: Ephemeral attribution for the current FX0A debug stop.
+# @delay-timer: Current delay timer value.
